What these are: hand-ported *scenarios*. Each case follows the situation a FreeCAD Sketcher
test exercises (box and rectangle helpers, slot plate, issue 3245 fillets, circle-line
distances, signed point-line distances, redundant symmetry, point on arc, ...). The geometry,
numbers and constraint sets were authored for Amalgam's constraint vocabulary; no FreeCAD
source file or data file is copied. Because the scenarios are derived from FreeCAD's tests,
each case is labelled LGPL-2.1-or-later and attributed here. The `origin` field of each case
names the FreeCAD scenario.

Use: JSON test data read by the corpus runner. Never compiled into or linked with any crate.
Expectations (status, DOF) were derived by hand and cross-checked against Amalgam's reference
oracle by crates/amg-sketch/tests/corpus_gen.rs.
